OL,3,GNEWSACheaper parking 'helping Cornish
OL,4,Ahigh street'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraders in a Cornish town have said a
OL,7,Ftrial of cheaper parking has led to
OL,8,Fincreased footfall and helped boost
OL,9,Fbusiness.
OL,11,FSince February, Cornwall Council has
OL,12,Fbeen offering three hours parking for a
OL,13,Fpound in the short-stay Cattle Market
OL,14,Fcar park in Launceston as part of a
OL,15,Fpilot scheme.
OL,17,FThe authority said it had increased
OL,18,Fusage there and the overall amount of
OL,19,Fmoney it had collected from the town's
OL,20,Fcar parks had stayed about the same.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
