OL,3,GNEWSACheaper parking 'helping Cornish
OL,4,Ahigh street'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council has agreed to extend it for
OL,7,Fa further six months before deciding
OL,8,Fwhether it can afford to make it
OL,9,Fpermanent - as well as looking at
OL,10,Fvarying tariffs to support other market
OL,11,Ftowns.
